#: includes/abilities/structure.php:112
msgid "The new commit name (absent on a dry run)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/structure.php:116
msgid "The active commit used for this result. Pass it as expected_commit when saving."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/structure.php:121
msgid "The resulting subtree markup (dry run only)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/structure.php:135
msgid "data-dbe-id markers that matched nothing in the subtree — probably typos. Each was treated as a new element, so the element it was meant to keep is removed and recreated with a fresh id. Check these before relying on the edit."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/structure.php:140
msgid "Data-binding problems that would render a silent empty loop: a Collection source that does not resolve to an array, {{ }} instead of a square-bracket global binding in data-b-context, a non-global variable, a [[ ]] data-source, or a missing <template> child. Fix these before trusting the result."
